&lt;h2 id="what-is-attention" class="relative group"&gt;What is attention? &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#what-is-attention" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Explain the intuition — why attention was invented, what problem it solves.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Sentiment Analysis Pipeline</title><link>https://keltonsantos.github.io/data_science_portfolio/projects/sentiment-analysis-pipeline/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://keltonsantos.github.io/data_science_portfolio/projects/sentiment-analysis-pipeline/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="overview" class="relative group"&gt;Overview &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#overview" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This project builds a production-ready sentiment analysis pipeline that classifies product reviews as positive, negative, or neutral. The system handles data ingestion, model training, evaluation, and serves predictions via a REST API.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>About me</title><link>https://keltonsantos.github.io/data_science_portfolio/about/</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://keltonsantos.github.io/data_science_portfolio/about/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="hi-im-kelton-" class="relative group"&gt;Hi, I&amp;rsquo;m Kelton 👋 &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#hi-im-kelton-" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m a Machine Learning Engineer and Data Scientist based in &lt;strong&gt;Praia, Cabo Verde&lt;/strong&gt;. I work on building end-to-end ML systems, from data collection and feature engineering to model deployment and monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mining Process Quality Analysis</title><link>https://keltonsantos.github.io/data_science_portfolio/projects/mining-process-analysis/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 Nov 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://keltonsantos.github.io/data_science_portfolio/projects/mining-process-analysis/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="overview" class="relative group"&gt;Overview &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#overview" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Data analysis project for a fictional mining company called &lt;strong&gt;Metals R&amp;rsquo; Us&lt;/strong&gt;, using real-world data from a flotation plant. The goal was to investigate process quality — specifically iron concentrate purity — and identify anomalies in the production data.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://keltonsantos.github.io/data_science_portfolio/resume/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://keltonsantos.github.io/data_science_portfolio/resume/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Books &amp; Resources</title><link>https://keltonsantos.github.io/data_science_portfolio/books/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://keltonsantos.github.io/data_science_portfolio/books/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="books" class="relative group"&gt;Books &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opaci